levant files.\n\n\nAnalyzing JNI transition mechanisms, specifically focusing on the performance implications of normal JNI calls versus `@FastNative` and `@CriticalNative`. The core concern is the overhead introduced by thread state transitions and `LocalReferenceTable` management within standard JNI calls. `@FastNative` eliminates the thread state switch for direct managed heap access, whereas `@CriticalNative` goes further, removing JNIEnv and stack frame wrapping, relying on direct register passing.\n\nNext, the focus will shift to concurrency and garbage collection, specifically Concurrent Mark and Compact (CMC), and Concurrent Copying (CC) GC algorithms, including sub-millisecond STW.  Investigating how `userfaultfd` is used in Generational CMC.\n\n\nTLABs, Region/BumpPointer/LargeObject space management are key for memory allocation. Concurrent Copying (CC) GC uses traditional read barriers; Generational CMC leverages `userfaultfd` for STW reduction. Dynamic heap growth factors and time-driven GC triggers adjust to process state. Native memory pressure monitoring, heap trimming, and anti-jank reference processing will be investigated. Native allocation registration and related GC checks are essential.\n\n\nExamining garbage collection urgency models and throttling mechanisms to prevent out-of-memory conditions and subsequent process termination by the system's low memory killer. This includes concurrency considerations of soft, weak, finalizer, and phantom references, specifically the non-blocking \"get\" fast path. I need to investigate the root causes of any performance issues related to finalizer reference processing.\n\nFocusing on Java object locking, I need to analyze the thin/fat lock inflation process, futex synchronization, and the mechanisms employed to prevent thread priority inversion. This entails studying the `LockWord` state machine and the relationship between Java and Linux thread priorities.\n\n\nJava object locking examines `LockWord` to prevent thread priority inversion through temporary priority elevation during blocking allocation and weak reference windowing, using `ScopedPriorityChange`.\n\nExamining runtime telemetry through ART metrics, Statd, and various Dexopt and Odrefresh metrics. Relevant code modules collect 48 runtime performance metrics. These metrics encompass session sampling and multiple backends, including Statsd, Logcat, and XML files. Also includes an application self-monitoring interface for blocked GC rate histograms and pre-OOM GC counts.\n\n\nReal-time monitoring of garbage collection and lock contention jank will be assessed. STW events exceeding 5ms, GC durations exceeding 100ms, and weak reference blocking above 10ms will be logged and traced. This will include analysis of page fault slices.\n\nLock contention will be sampled, and blocking periods will be monitored for `futex` timeouts, including stack dumps and Systrace lock slices.\nMethod tracing and low-overhead circular buffer mechanisms will also be investigated.\n\n\nAnalyzing the evolution of tracing mechanisms from traditional instrumented tracing to the more efficient `TraceProfiler` utilizing a circular buffer. This includes verifying the integration of `TraceProfiler` with debugging infrastructure for methods exceeding 341ms and full-method tracing with minimal overhead. The code should clarify the seqlock memory model and its role in resolving mixed stacks using `simpleperf`/`perfetto`. I must assess the utilization of `eBPF` `uprobe` offsets.\n\nThe investigation extends to Java heap memory profiling, focusing on sampling techniques, and snapshot mechanisms. The goal is to fully understand `HeapSampler` from `Perfetto`, and the double-fork `perfetto_hprof` implementation, along with the standard `HPROF`. I need to assess allocation record management within the GC modules and their interaction with these profiling tools.\n\n\n`HeapSampler` uses a Poisson exponential distribution to dynamically shrink TLABs, enabling low-overhead continuous stack sampling for `heapprofd`.  `perfetto_hprof` utilizes a `__SIGRTMIN + 6` signal and double-fork CoW for online heap graph capture with millisecond pauses, incorporating a 120s watchdog and `smaps` correlation. `HPROF` tools are compared to understand allocation record management in GC modules.\n\nANR pre-triggering mechanism uses `sigqueue(SIGUSR1)` to record long-running methods via `TraceProfiler`. The `SIGQUIT` signal initiates concurrent dumps, enabling robust ANR diagnosis. Relevant files reveal the architecture for pre-ANR long method recording.\n\n\nFocusing on thread suspension mechanisms, I need to understand the interplay between cooperative suspension requests and implicit checks. The timeout state machine requires careful analysis, considering exemptions for debugging, low-priority threads, and ANR scenarios. The goal is to determine how unresponsive threads are identified and terminated via `SIGABRT` for accurate crash dumps.\n\n\nAnalyzing `libsigchain`, specifically how it intercepts `sigaction` and `sigprocmask` to prioritize ART signal handling while maintaining compatibility with third-party crash SDKs. The `FaultManager` differentiates between managed-code implicit exceptions (null pointer, stack overflow, suspension issues, and `SIGBUS` from `userfaultfd`) and genuine native memory corruption, including ARM64 MTE tag errors, and forwards them to `debuggerd`.\n\nAssessing JNI safety mechanisms by examining `check_jni.cc` and related modules. Key focus is on JNI reference table overflow detection and heap corruption verification. This includes understanding the role of indirect and local reference tables and object verification within garbage collection.\n\n\nJNI safety mechanisms are examined to prevent common errors like illegal thread states, pending exception calls, and reference errors. Reference table overflow protection and heap corruption verification are key areas.  OOM diagnostics include pre-OOM GC cycles and anti-GC-thrashing thresholds. Further investigation involves byte code verification, API control, and compilation watchdogs, encompassing OOM dump generation and analysis of related logs.\n\n\nInitial investigation reveals mechanisms focusing on out-of-memory detection and prevention, byte code verification, hidden API restrictions, and boot-loop protection. These relate directly to the \"stability\" aspect. The analysis will be documented in `implementation_plan.md`. The plan must cover 16 mechanisms for app performance and stability. Wiki generation will be suspended until user approval.\n\n\nThe analysis framework shifts to a structured wiki generation plan. A unified template is now specified in `implementation_plan.md` to ensure consistency. Each wiki will cover mechanism definition, design rationale, and practical application. Metadata, diagrams, and code context will be included in the documentation for each mechanism.\n\n\nFocusing on creating comprehensive documentation for each identified mechanism. Each wiki will detail the mechanism's implementation details using diagrams and code examples. Practical applications, including tuning, debugging, and relevant command-line tools, will be included. A comprehensive index of core classes, functions, and files will be maintained.\n\n\nA plan for wiki generation will be added to the `implementation_plan.md` artifact. The plan specifies a template for mechanism documentation covering definition, design, application, diagrams, code context, and an index of core elements.\n\nA task file, `task.md`, will be created to track individual tasks within the overall project.\n\nI will start by reviewing the artifact directory.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"ART App 性能与稳定性机制研究及系列技术 Wiki 编写任务清单（共 16 个核心机制专题 Task + 1 个全景总览索引）。","UserFacing":true},"Content":"# ART App 性能与稳定性机制研究任务清单（Task Checklist）\n\n> **源码基线**：[art](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art)（Android 15/16 主线级 QSSI 仓库）  \n> **产出目录**：`/home/ethen/workspace/github/ethenslab/work/art-wiki/`\n\n## 阶段零：源码盘点与研究规划\n- [x] 全量扫描 `art` 仓库源码目录，确认 App 性能与稳定性核心机制清单（共 4 大域、16 条独立机制）\n- [x] 对齐研究边界、输出路径与单文件自包含图文规范，输出 [implementation_plan.md](file:///home/ethen/.gemini/antigravity/brain/db260ba4-b7ce-4b54-9228-5adc342f0f21/implementation_plan.md)\n\n## 专题一：App 执行、编译与启动性能加速机制\n- [ ] **Task 01**：研究并输出 `01-tiered-execution-and-jit-aot.md` —— 混合执行引擎与分层编译机制（Switch / Nterp / Fast Baseline JIT / Optimizing JIT & OSR / AOT）\n- [ ] **Task 02**：研究并输出 `02-pgo-profile-and-dexopt-pipeline.md` —— PGO 热点画像采集与编译治理闭环（`ProfileSaver` / `profman` / Cloud DM / `artd` & Pre-reboot Dexopt）\n- [ ] **Task 03**：研究并输出 `03-app-startup-and-image-caching.md` —— App 启动加速与类/镜像预热机制（BootImage / JitZygote / AppImage / `RuntimeImage` / `StartupCompletedTask` / `madvise`）\n- [ ] **Task 04**：研究并输出 `04-fast-jni-transition-optimization.md` —— 高性能 JNI 跨界调用优化机制（Normal JNI / `@FastNative` / `@CriticalNative` 与编译器 JNI Stub）\n\n## 专题二：App 内存管理、并发同步与防卡顿（Anti-Jank）机制\n- [ ] **Task 05**：研究并输出 `05-concurrent-gc-cmc-and-cc.md` —— 并发垃圾回收与亚毫秒级 STW 机制（Generational CMC `userfaultfd` / Concurrent Copying / TLAB 分配与前后台感知）\n- [ ] **Task 06**：研究并输出 `06-native-gc-trigger-and-ref-processing.md` —— Native 内存压力联动回收与引用处理防卡顿机制（`NativeAllocationRegistry` 紧急度节流 / `ReferenceProcessor` 并发状态机）\n- [ ] **Task 07**：研究并输出 `07-monitor-lock-inflation-and-priority.md` —— Java 锁膨胀状态机与线程优先级防反转机制（Thin/Fat Lock 膨胀收缩 / `futex` / `ScopedPriorityChange`）\n\n## 专题三：App 性能可观测性、指标遥测与低开销剖析机制\n- [ ] **Task 08**：研究并输出 `08-art-telemetry-metrics-and-statsd.md` —— ART 运行时与编译服务遥测指标体系（`ArtMetrics` 48 项指标 / Statsd / `VMDebug.getRuntimeStat` / Dexopt & Odrefresh 遥测）\n- [ ] **Task 09**：研究并输出 `09-gc-and-lock-jank-observability.md` —— GC 与锁竞争卡顿实时监测体系（慢 GC 日志 / Systrace 缺页打点 / `dvm_lock_sample` 采样 / `PerfMonitor` 阻塞期抓栈）\n- [ ] **Task 10**：研究并输出 `10-method-tracing-and-cpu-profiling.md` —— 方法追踪、低开销环形缓冲与原生符号桥接机制（`Trace` / `TraceProfiler` 长方法捕获 / JIT ELF 符号注册 / eBPF 偏移接口 / JVMTI）\n- [ ] **Task 11**：研究并输出 `11-java-heap-sampling-and-hprof.md` —— Java 堆采样剖析与双 Fork 快照机制（Perfetto `HeapSampler` TLAB 采样 / `perfetto_hprof` 双 Fork 零拷贝抓堆 / HPROF）\n\n## 专题四：App 稳定性防护、超时看门狗与崩溃取证机制\n- [ ] **Task 12**：研究并输出 `12-anr-sigquit-dump-and-diagnostics.md` —— ANR 全景诊断转储与 Pre-ANR 长方法录制机制（`SignalCatcher` / `SIGUSR1` 联动 / `DumpOrder` 防截断排序 / `DebugStore`）\n- [ ] **Task 13**：研究并输出 `13-thread-suspension-and-watchdog.md` —— 线程安全点挂起机制与超时精准自杀看门狗（安全点协议 / `WaitForSuspendBarrier` 动态豁免 / `AbortInThis` 肇事线程归因）\n- [ ] **Task 14**：研究并输出 `14-signal-chaining-and-fault-handler.md` —— 硬件异常拦截与 Native Crash 信号链机制（`libsigchain` 防覆盖劫持 / `FaultManager` 隐式异常转换与 MTE 崩溃分流）\n- [ ] **Task 15**：研究并输出 `15-checkjni-ref-leak-and-heap-verify.md` —— CheckJNI 契约防护、引用表溢出诊断与堆踩踏取证机制（`CheckJNI` 慢锁与违规拦截 / GlobalRef 泄漏栈追踪 / `LogHeapCorruption`）\n- [ ] **Task 16**：研究并输出 `16-oom-verifier-hiddenapi-and-watchdogs.md` —— OOM 死亡抓堆、字节码校验、API 管控与编译防变砖机制（OOM 晋升回收与自动抓堆 / `MethodVerifier` / `hidden_api` & DCL / `dex2oat` & `odrefresh` 看门狗）\n\n## 阶段五：全景总览索引与质量校验\n- [ ] **Task 17**：输出知识库总入口 `README.md`（ART 性能与稳定性全景架构图、16 大机制导航矩阵、排障场景速查决策树）并完成全量链接与图表语法校验\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/ethen/.gemini/antigravity/brain/db260ba4-b7ce-4b54-9228-5adc342f0f21/task.md"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":true,"Summary":"基于 /home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art 源码确立的 16 项“App 性能与稳定性机制”全景研究计划，包含源码模块映射、16 个一对一研究 Task 拆分、单文件图文并茂 Wiki 编写标准（What/Why/How/实战应用）及并行研究执行方案。","UserFacing":true},"Content":"# ART “App 性能与稳定性机制”全景源码研究与系列技术 Wiki 实施计划\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **研究基线与目标产物**\n> - **源码根路径**：[art](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art)（Android 15/16 主线级 QSSI 仓库，`libartpalette` SDK 36.1）\n> - **知识库输出目录**：`/home/ethen/workspace/github/ethenslab/work/art-wiki/`\n> - **图表与排版规范**：纯 Markdown 自包含文档（内置 **Mermaid** 架构图/时序图/状态机图/类图 + **ASCII/Unicode 内存与数据结构框图** + **结构化对比矩阵** + **精确到行号的源码链接**）。\n\n---\n\n## 一、 基于 ART 源码确立的“App 性能与稳定性”机制全景图\n\n通过对 [art](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art) 下 `runtime/`、`compiler/`、`dex2oat/`、`odrefresh/`、`artd/`、`libartservice/`、`libprofile/`、`profman/`、`perfetto_hprof/`、`sigchainlib/`、`openjdkjvmti/`、`libartpalette/`、`libartbase/` 等全部核心子目录的源码审计，ART 围绕 **App 性能** 与 **App 稳定性** 共实现了 **4 大领域、16 条核心机制**：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    subgraph PerfExec[\"专题一：执行、编译与启动性能加速\"]\n        M01[\"01. 混合执行与分层编译<br/>Switch / Nterp / Baseline & Opt JIT / AOT\"]\n        M02[\"02. PGO 热点画像与编译闭环<br/>ProfileSaver / profman / DM / artd\"]\n        M03[\"03. 启动加速与镜像预热<br/>BootImage / JitZygote / AppImage / RuntimeImage\"]\n        M04[\"04. 高性能 JNI 跨界优化<br/>Normal / FastNative / CriticalNative\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph PerfMem[\"专题二：内存管理、并发同步与防卡顿\"]\n        M05[\"05. 并发 GC 与亚毫秒 STW<br/>Generational CMC userfaultfd & CC\"]\n        M06[\"06. Native 内存联动与弱引用防卡顿<br/>NativeAllocationRegistry & ReferenceProcessor\"]\n        M07[\"07. 锁膨胀状态机与优先级防反转<br/>Thin-Fat Lock / futex / ScopedPriorityChange\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Obs[\"专题三：性能可观测性、遥测与剖析\"]\n        M08[\"08. 运行时与编译遥测指标<br/>ArtMetrics / Statsd / VMDebug / DexoptStats\"]\n        M09[\"09. GC 与锁竞争卡顿实时监测<br/>Slow GC / PageFault ATrace / PerfMonitor\"]\n        M10[\"10. 方法追踪与 CPU 剖析桥接<br/>Trace / TraceProfiler / JIT ELF DebugInfo\"]\n        M11[\"11. Java 堆采样与双 Fork 快照<br/>HeapSampler TLAB / perfetto_hprof / HPROF\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Stab[\"专题四：稳定性防护、看门狗与崩溃取证\"]\n        M12[\"12. ANR 全景转储与 Pre-ANR 录制<br/>SignalCatcher / SIGUSR1 / DumpOrder / DebugStore\"]\n        M13[\"13. 线程挂起协议与肇事线程看门狗<br/>Safepoint / SuspendBarrier / AbortInThis\"]\n        M14[\"14. 硬件异常拦截与信号链机制<br/>libsigchain / FaultManager / MTE 分流\"]\n        M15[\"15. CheckJNI、引用防漏与堆踩踏取证<br/>CheckJNI / GlobalRef Trace / LogHeapCorruption\"]\n        M16[\"16. OOM 抓堆、校验、API 与防变砖看门狗<br/>OOM Hook / Verifier / HiddenAPI / dex2oat WatchDog\"]\n    end\n\n    PerfExec --> Obs\n    PerfMem --> Obs\n    PerfExec --> Stab\n    PerfMem --> Stab\n```\n\n---\n\n## 二、 16 个研究 Task 与产出技术 Wiki 详细拆解\n\n每一条机制均建立一个独立研究 Task，产出一份高信息密度技术 Wiki：\n\n### 专题一：App 执行、编译与启动性能加速机制\n\n| Task ID | 机制名称 | 目标 Wiki 文件 | 核心研读源码范围（相对于 `qssi/art/`） | 核心研究点与实战价值 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Task 01** | **混合执行引擎与分层编译机制** | `01-tiered-execution-and-jit-aot.md` | [nterp.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/interpreter/mterp/nterp.cc)、`runtime/interpreter/mterp/arm64ng/`、[jit.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/jit.cc)、[jit_code_cache.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/jit_code_cache.cc)、[fast_compiler_arm64.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/compiler/optimizing/fast_compiler_arm64.cc)、[optimizing_compiler.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/compiler/optimizing/optimizing_compiler.cc)、[cha.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/cha.cc)、[escape.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/compiler/optimizing/escape.cc) | Nterp 零转换栈帧设计、热度阈值递减、ARM64 快速基线编译器、基于 Inline Cache 与 CHA 的激进内联/去虚化/逃逸分析、OSR 栈上替换与反优化回退；指导编译过滤器选型与 CPU 热点优化。 |\n| **Task 02** | **PGO 热点画像采集与编译治理闭环** | `02-pgo-profile-and-dexopt-pipeline.md` | [profile_saver.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/profile_saver.cc)、[profile_assistant.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/profman/profile_assistant.cc)、[ArtManagerLocal.java](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/ArtManagerLocal.java)、[BackgroundDexoptJob.java](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/BackgroundDexoptJob.java)、[PreRebootDexoptJob.java](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com