/ PageFault ATrace / PerfMonitor\"]\n33:         M10[\"10. 方法追踪与 CPU 剖析桥接<br/>Trace / TraceProfiler / JIT ELF DebugInfo\"]\n34:         M11[\"11. Java 堆采样与双 Fork 快照<br/>HeapSampler TLAB / perfetto_hprof / HPROF\"]\n35:     end\n36: \n37:     subgraph Stab[\"专题四：稳定性防护、看门狗与崩溃取证\"]\n38:         M12[\"12. ANR 全景转储与 Pre-ANR 录制<br/>SignalCatcher / SIGUSR1 / DumpOrder / DebugStore\"]\n39:         M13[\"13. 线程挂起协议与肇事线程看门狗<br/>Safepoint / SuspendBarrier / AbortInThis\"]\n40:         M14[\"14. 硬件异常拦截与信号链机制<br/>libsigchain / FaultManager / MTE 分流\"]\n41:         M15[\"15. CheckJNI、引用防漏与堆踩踏取证<br/>CheckJNI / GlobalRef Trace / LogHeapCorruption\"]\n42:         M16[\"16. OOM 抓堆、校验、API 与防变砖看门狗<br/>OOM Hook / Verifier / HiddenAPI / dex2oat WatchDog\"]\n43:     end\n44: \n45:     PerfExec --> Obs\n46:     PerfMem --> Obs\n47:     PerfExec --> Stab\n48:     PerfMem --> Stab\n49: ```\n50: \n51: ---\n52: \n53: ## 二、 16 个研究 Task 与产出技术 Wiki 详细拆解\n54: \n55: 每一条机制均建立一个独立研究 Task，产出一份高信息密度技术 Wiki：\n56: \n57: ### 专题一：App 执行、编译与启动性能加速机制\n58: \n59: | Task ID | 机制名称 | 目标 Wiki 文件 | 核心研读源码范围（相对于 `qssi/art/`） | 核心研究点与实战价值 |\n60: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n61: | **Task 01** | **混合执行引擎与分层编译机制** | `01-tiered-execution-and-jit-aot.md` | [nterp.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/interpreter/mterp/nterp.cc)、`runtime/interpreter/mterp/arm64ng/`、[jit.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/jit.cc)、[jit_code_cache.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/jit_code_cache.cc)、[fast_compiler_arm64.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/compiler/optimizing/fast_compiler_arm64.cc)、[optimizing_compiler.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/compiler/optimizing/optimizing_compiler.cc)、[cha.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/cha.cc)、[escape.cc](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code